  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance humanitaire en abris pour les populations vuln&#xE9;rables affect&#xE9;es par les conflits au Nord-Kivu, R&#xE9;publique d&#xE9;mocratique du Congo (RDC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide life-saving shelter and essential household item assistance to internally displaced persons members in Goma, Lubero, Nyiragongo, and Rutshuru. This IOM project constructs 2,000 emergency shelters and distributes 2,000 essential household item kits. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 10,000 people, including 3,700 women, 3,200 men, 3,100 children, and including 150 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
